# What Vercel deploys is the committed HTML at the repo root, assets/, and api/.
# The build pipeline and its tests run locally, so keeping them out of the
# upload means no build script or test file is publicly fetchable from the site.
# Removing this file changes nothing about how the site renders; it only makes
# those paths reachable again.
